  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, equation $x^{2}+2 x y+y^{2}-5 x+5 y-5=0$\r\n$\\Rightarrow(x+y)^{2}=5 x-5 y+5$\r\n$\\Rightarrow(x+y)^{2}=5(x-y+1)$\r\n$\\therefore$ Axis of the parabola is $x+y=0$",
    "image": null
